  "Message": "feat(dawarich): deploy location tracker with PostGIS, OIDC \u0026 monitoring (#300)\n\nSelf-hosted Dawarich 1.8.1 at locate.f4mily.net.\n\n- App: single pod (web + sidekiq) sharing RWO PVCs (public/watched/storage),\n  Valkey for cache + Sidekiq queue\n- DB: dedicated CNPG PostGIS cluster (postgis:17-3.5) with postgis extension,\n  S3 barman backup + daily ScheduledBackup; mirrors the immich-postgres pattern\n- OIDC SSO via Authentik (blueprint + provider/application, auto-register on\n  first login); built-in login retained for admin bootstrap\n- Gatus health endpoint (/api/v1/health) + README catalog row\n- Secrets (SECRET_KEY_BASE, DB credentials, OIDC client) SOPS-encrypted\n\nCo-authored-by: Sebastian Preisner \u003cpreisner@puzzle-itc.de\u003e\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
  "Tags": [],
